---
title: "Home"
layout: base
---

<h1>Take this, it's not safe to go alone.</h1>
<div>
  <h2>PowerShell</h2>  <div style="position: relative;">
    {% highlight "powershell" %}Invoke-RestMethod "https://jbeers.github.io/res/my_terminal_config.ps1" | Invoke-Expression{% endhighlight %}
    <button 
      style="position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; background: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--surface); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px;"
      onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('Invoke-RestMethod &quot;https://jbeers.github.io/res/my_terminal_config.ps1&quot; | Invoke-Expression')"
      title="Copy to clipboard">
      📋
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
<div>
  <h2>Bash</h2>  <div style="position: relative;">
    {% highlight "bash" %}source <(curl -sSL "https://github.com/jbeers/jtb-env/blob/main/shell-scripts/.bashrc?raw=true"){% endhighlight %}
    <button 
      style="position: absolute; top: 8px; right: 8px; background: var(--secondary); border: 1px solid var(--surface); border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px;"
      onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('source &lt;(curl -sSL &quot;https://github.com/jbeers/jtb-env/blob/main/shell-scripts/.bashrc?raw=true&quot;)')"
      title="Copy to clipboard">
      📋
    </button>
  </div>
</div>